'''Death''' is a [[divination card]]. A set of four can be exchanged for {{il|Mon'tregul's Grasp}}.

{{Item acquisition}}

This card is only able to  theoretically drop in [[The Karui Fortress]] through a {{c|mod|+5 Chest level}} [[strongbox]].

